Z||000000||GT-maniac||06-03-2001||02:03 AM||||Hurray I finally have a running fiero again !. Put the new 2.8 in on the weekend and she just purrs. Lots of fun trying to get the front cradle bolts out, I finally had to use an air chisel to push em out and then had all the fun of trying to line the cradle holes up again to put the new bolts in. Lots of work but it all seems worth it now.I haven't driven a fiero for 9 months and had forgotten just how much fun to drive they are . Next project is to get the 87 GT to run as nice nice as my 85 GT does.||||reg||1
